#: ../../source/api/cli/efficiency.md:1 f75ccb66977d4501998dc0333e1fe8e9
msgid "efficiency.py 命令行参考"
msgstr "efficiency.py Command Line Reference"

#: ../../source/api/cli/efficiency.md:3 f3fb7b0ba2aa44a49556ae93d0e486e6
msgid ""
"`efficiency.py` 是 UniKT 内置的硬件级模型计算能效评测工具，用于测量模型的推断延迟、训练吞吐率、显存峰值消耗、PyTorch"
" 算子级耗时以及 `torch.compile` 加速收益。"
msgstr ""
"`efficiency.py` is UniKT's built-in hardware-level computational "
"efficiency evaluation tool, used to measure model inference latency, "
"training throughput, peak GPU memory consumption, PyTorch operator-level "
"timing, and `torch.compile` speedup gains."

#: ../../source/api/cli/efficiency.md:5 2918e20e4bf04049a7a159ae9cb34cb2
msgid "运行模式"
msgstr "Execution Modes"

#: ../../source/api/cli/efficiency.md:7 3e38bc1f2d9c44cd95800e2f0184fa89
msgid "`efficiency.py` 支持两种互斥的入口模式："
msgstr "`efficiency.py` supports two mutually exclusive entry modes:"

#: ../../source/api/cli/efficiency.md:9 09c8e0a243054e27b7bb8c4314284202
msgid ""
"**从头构建模式**：通过 `-m` 与 `-d` 实例化模型与数据（可使用随机初始化权重，或指定 `--efficiency.weights` "
"加载权重）："
msgstr ""
"**Scratch Build Mode**: Instantiate model and data via `-m` and `-d` "
"(using randomly initialized weights, or specifying `--efficiency.weights`"
" to load weights):"

#: ../../source/api/cli/efficiency.md:10 f8c1524801244e67890bcc4ff9dd2f4b
msgid "python efficiency.py -m GIKT -d assistments09\n"
msgstr "python efficiency.py -m GIKT -d assistments09\n"

#: ../../source/api/cli/efficiency.md:13 037ff40ea181418e926e8959f5147fe4
msgid ""
"**实验归档复现模式**：指定训练实验目录 `--efficiency.run_dir`，系统自动加载归档的 `run_config.yaml` "
"与最优权重检查点："
msgstr ""
"**Archived Experiment Mode**: Specify the training experiment directory "
"`--efficiency.run_dir`, and the system automatically loads the archived "
"`run_config.yaml` and best checkpoint weights:"

#: ../../source/api/cli/efficiency.md:14 d58abf143ebe40f1a8951f130fd09794
msgid ""
"python efficiency.py --efficiency.run_dir "
"runs/normal/GIKT_assistments09_20261109-120000_fold0_bs128\n"
msgstr ""
"python efficiency.py --efficiency.run_dir "
"runs/normal/GIKT_assistments09_20261109-120000_fold0_bs128\n"

