msgid "利用 PyTorch Profiler 捕获算子执行栈，统计 GPU/CPU 核函数耗时前 10 的核心算子。"
msgstr ""
"Capture operator execution callstacks using PyTorch Profiler, identifying"
" top 10 core operators by GPU/CPU kernel execution time."

